      "id": "claim_be7339fa49f34630ab8f2d0ed034e747",
      "statement": "The web dashboard is a single owned system: src/bosshunter/web/server.py defines one Bottle app that serves JSON under /api/* and the built React/TypeScript assets from web/frontend/dist under /*, with SPA fallback to index.html for non-API routes and a JSON 404 for unknown API routes.",
