    {
      "id": "claim_660b969448a7480bbda3c75e9b539c1b",
      "statement": "WorkbenchTaskRunner enforces a single active non-parallel task under a lock, raising TaskAlreadyRunningError on conflict; only the short reply and import modes may start alongside a long task, and two same-type short tasks remain mutually exclusive.",
