    {
      "id": "claim_d05abb553e6940039805bbd5f3dfce1f",
      "statement": "Task stop is cooperative: stop() sets the stop_requested Event, moves the task to stopping, and wakes any parked confirmation Event, while _run() assigns the terminal status completed/failed/stopped and only releases the active slot after the executor thread actually returns.",
