    {
      "id": "claim_03fac20127bd4ad5b4d2f90397c24dec",
      "statement": "Full, monitor, and deliver tasks resolve an automatic stop deadline from throttle.send_windows via SendWindowChecker; a Timer calls stop() at the deadline, and a task whose deadline is already past is recorded stopped without starting a worker thread.",
