    {
      "id": "claim_ae7ed0d6fe5248cf8cbebdf2c9ac02e6",
      "statement": "Task state is upserted into the workbench_tasks table on every change and restored on startup; rows left in running or stopping by a previous process are rewritten to stopped with reason '服务重启，任务未自动恢复' and are never auto-resumed.",
