    {
      "id": "claim_281ac9c4849b4405a0c9dcb5c195bc27",
      "statement": "The full-mode executor composes collect, a pending-confirmation wait, deliver, and monitor: it parks on an in-process confirmation_event after selecting jobs at or above the scoring threshold, then continues to deliver and monitor once the frontend supplies confirmed job ids.",
